cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "HYPERBENCH: Computational Frameworks for Traversable Hyperspace"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework treating candidate spacetime geometries as program
  objects: symbolic curvature derivation, machine-checkable energy-condition
  audits, constrained optimisation of exotic-matter budgets, and control-theoretic
  analysis of dynamic throat stabilisation.
authors:
